			"text": "Horizontal louvre slats for walls and plant cages: two per repeat, each sloping back from its lip into the dark gap behind the next one. Lit from above the slat tops catch the light and the gaps stay black. Tint it with the model's colour. For pressed tank vents use vent-slots.",
